freedreno/a5xx: the register file holds 64 vec4

a5xx has been sharing a4xx's reg_size_vec4 of 48, but the sweep behind the
bank bound put its boundary at 512 half-units, which is 64 vec4 of four
components at two halves each.

The whole generation gets the value: a505 to a540 already share one
threadsize_base and one wave_granularity, and nothing here distinguishes their
register files.  Only a530 is measured.

Understating the file costs occupancy everywhere, and costs correctness where
a barrier workgroup has to fit inside it: that budget is a share of
reg_size_vec4, so a quarter of the file goes missing from every wave and
shaders are held below what the hardware runs.

